Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:42.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today, Jenoman military adviser and leader\Nof the democratic revolution, Marcelo Jarti,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was attacked and assassinated in Panan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.18,0:01:52.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The incident occurred at the hotel he\Nwas staying at with the advisory group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:58.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Judging by the scale of the\Nattack, he is thought to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:03.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The leader of the democratic\Nrevolution and a legendary hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He commanded many battles against\Nguerilla groups alongside the President,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:09.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and guided the country to a successful revolution.\NHe is a man of merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:14.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, after the revolution,\Nhe showed no interest in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:19.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He believed that he was just a\Nsoldier supporting the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:23.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He was said to be leading many\Nrevolutions in neighbouring countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:30.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He miraculously survived 5 assassination\Nattempts made by the SAS and DELTA,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:34.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and was thought to be an invulnerable\Nhero in his own country...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's coming out... It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.68,0:02:47.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Inspector, scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Walking pattern, cyborged from both knees down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:07.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The way he unconsciously strokes his cyborged right arm\Nis clearly a symptom of a phantom limb,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:11.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and is a strong physical characteristic indicating the existence of a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:20.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Some other behaviour patterns match the databank of the\NEuropean Police, identifying him as Marcelo Jarti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:27.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The legendary hero has been\Nentering the country repeatedly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:32.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, I'll follow Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Switch with me in 13 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.52,0:03:41.50,BLACK,,350,0,350,,{\b1\i0}I\ND\NO\NL\NA\NT\NR\NY{\b0\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:47.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Regarding the assassination attempt on Jenoman\NMilitary Adviser Marcelo Jarti reported earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:51.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the government has officially\Ndeclared that he is alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.15,0:03:55.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although according to the official report by the\Ngovernment, Marcelo suffered an injury to his right arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.89,0:04:00.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone's being fooled by a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:03.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the sixth assassination attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.49,0:04:07.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just that the targets were all fakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there any proof that the one\Nthat the Major's following is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:14.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It can't be proven; it's a matter of probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Does the data that the inspector\Ndug up identify him as the real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is also a matter of probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:25.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Argh, too much trouble,\Njust ghost hack him and make it all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:30.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa is following Marcelo's\Ntaxi from the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We should be hearing from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:35.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Locate his hideout first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put it under 24-hour surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:46.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marcelo has entered this country twelve times, almost\Nonce every five months over the past five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:49.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Police Department seems to have noticed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:55.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the foreign affairs section\Nwas unaware of his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:56.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So they came to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:58.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:02.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They want us to find out why Marcelo\Nis entering our country so frequently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Any possibility that it's because\Nhe's the drug king of South America?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:12.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's hard to imagine that Marcelo would risk\Ncoming here by himself just for a drug trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:20.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Japan, where cyberbrain drugs are mainstream, is not an\Nattractive market for Marcelo who deals in natural drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If he's the real one,\Nlet's just take him down ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:30.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because of interference from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs,\Nwe have to let him go home peacefully this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I've located Marcelo's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:38.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:40.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,New Port Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.06,0:05:44.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He switched cars 6 times, and settled down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:50.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu, Bouma, go to the New Port Hotel.\NTogusa, wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma? How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I looked through the Hotel's guest list,\Nbut there are no guests with the name Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:13.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He got off the elevator on level 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:15.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are VIP rooms there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:34.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:58.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou! You ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:01.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ya, ya, anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:03.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You like high places, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I certainly do like high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's there. Marcelo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:30.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are a few other visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:38.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hm? I hear a cart coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A Maid Robot's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:43.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good, I'll borrow her eyes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you sure we won't get traced?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I won't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Room service...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:19.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marcelo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:25.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Comparing with Marcelo Jarti's data... matched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:28.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ishikawa, look up the man with Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doing it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:35.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:39.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kanekichi Gondou, a member of Kourinkai,\Nleader of the Niihama Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:44.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can definitely call him the central figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:48.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He controls almost all of the\Ncyberbrain drug flow in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:53.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kourinkai practically owns this hotel too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:00.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is the Police. Gondou's inside, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I need to have a talk with him.\NWill you open the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:06.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have no business with cops. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't touch me punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:17.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on, I'm looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you want, fucker?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:21.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, the cops taking action in the hotel are Prefecture\NPolice trying to raid the scene of a drug trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:26.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're after Gondou, not Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:30.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If the Prefecture Police get\NMarcelo, it'll screw things up badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:31.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Help Marcelo escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It might get a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:35.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:37.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, we're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:52.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn it... We have no choice.\NWe have to hurry to our usual spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:56.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys, hold the cops here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They sure were messy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.61,0:12:18.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm finished. The c-c-cops are on to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:20.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I-I-I'm finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:29.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is Togusa, I'm following Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:30.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:34.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In 8 minutes, Pazu and Bouma will take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:41.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, could you find out how many\Nfacilities Kourinkai has in the prefecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:46.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Also, could you check for videos of Marcelo around the\Ncapital back from when he first entered the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:52.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay, retrieve all camera data for\Nthe past five years of Marcelo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:55.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All the facilities that Kourinkai possesses too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I let him escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:48.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:55.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:58.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Over the last five years,\Nthere are some video records of Marcelo Jarti
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:04.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,from the service area of the freeway that\Ngoes to the mountains outside of Niihama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Comparing it with the behaviour pattern of Marcelo,\Nwe can pick up some of Kourinkai's facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:12.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sending the data now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:16.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A huge warehouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have some weird data on the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Every time Marcelo entered the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:26.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there were dates when the electricity\Nusage was abnormally high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:27.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Electricity usage...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:30.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is Bouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:33.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marcelo has left his car and\Nhas got on to the roadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:36.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll have the Tachikoma continue the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:47.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:09.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Image from the Tachikoma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Marcelo and Gondou are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:20.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hmm, there aren't that many guards either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is Togusa, I'm in the back of the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:26.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:31.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As soon as Ishikawa takes control of the\Nfacility's lines, we're going to detain Marcelo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm finished, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:18.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:24.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sweet dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, did you hear him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:44.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've found him. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}"Major, did you hear him?"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:50.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}"I've found him. It's him."{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:01.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So this jamming of the radio waves is the reason\Nbehind the noise in the communication system...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:02.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hm? It's that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}"Attack on my mark!"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.62,0:17:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:16.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou! Marcelo's in the plant. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:20.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? What? I can't hear you, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No good... Togusa, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.63,0:17:26.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:39.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:00.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are two Marcelos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:13.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? What are you talking about, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've already caught Marcelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.18,0:19:18.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:20.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:22.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've caught Marcelo, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ghost Dubbing Device...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:56.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Walking pattern, cyborged from both knees down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:01.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The way he unconsciously strokes his cyborged right arm\Nis clearly a symptom of a phantom limb,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and is a strong physical characteristic indicating the existence of a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:13.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Some other behaviour patterns match\Nthe databank of the European Police,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:16.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,identifying him as Marcelo Jarti.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He says he's real...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:21.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:26.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Chief said not to let any\Norganisation know, but is that ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:28.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a global scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:33.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Tell them Marcelo himself is already dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But what a South American stud!\NHe endured ghost dubbing 3 times!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:46.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Kourinkai was scared of retaliation\Nwhen Marcelo finally died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They somehow continued dubbing\Nwithout the country noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:22:00.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was convenient to mass-produce doubles,\Nbut then they needed to synchronise the doubles' memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:07.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, they couldn't allow individual differences, and they\Nhad to make everyone believe the real one was alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:10.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So that was the reason for the sightseeing trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:16.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I still don't understand what circumstances\Nmade them take such a huge risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.13,0:22:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's because he's a hero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.14,0:22:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What will happen to the citizens, when they\Nfind out the hero they admire is a doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A doll that continues to speak of dreams is slightly better\Nthan a dysfunctional hero in name only.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.23,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
